# Project Knowledge Detail

## Executive Summary

`PPJxQSee.AI` is an external collaboration / vendor evaluation for QSee.ai focused on QC and Production AI vision use cases such as defect detection, measurement support, visual inspection, image classification, and production quality monitoring.

Current status: NDA approved and use case / PoC discussion preparation. The project should only move into delivery when PoC scope, data requirements, data privacy controls, and measurable success criteria are clear.

Initial data needs include product images, defect images by defect type, initial 5-10 images per defect for evaluation, measurement standards, defect labels, cm/inch measurement rules if applicable, and NDA/data permission controls.

## Business Context

This project belongs to the PPJ AI/Automation portfolio. The repaired managed block records business meaning, ownership gaps, data/source-of-truth needs, risks, decisions, and next actions without changing the filename or user-written content outside the managed block.

## Problem Statement

The existing generated block used generic wording and may not contain enough project-specific business detail. This repair makes the block more conservative, clearer, and easier to validate.

## Objectives

- Clarify project-specific business meaning.
- Identify missing owner, data, and workflow details.
- Prepare the note for business confirmation and deliverable creation.

